  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`, `onLinear` and `onCircular`: the post arms AICC smoothing (`G5.1 Q1 R<n>`) only when no canned-cycle group is open (`!inCycle`).\n- `assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`, `endPreamble`: the post writes `G80` before `disableSmoothing()`. Thus `G5.1 Q0` never comes while G81-G89 is modal.\n- `crates/post/tests/doosan_dnm_post.rs`: new pin `doosan_dnm_smoothing_stays_out_of_open_cycle_group`.\n- `docs/decisions/4347-dnm-smoothing-cycle.md`: the decision record.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe hole chain of a cycle (plunge, retract to R) reaches `onLinear`. The old code called `enableSmoothing()` before `chainCut()` dropped the move. Each hole wrote `G5.1 Q1 R5`, and the next cycle block or the section end wrote `G5.1 Q0`. All these words were inside the group. The section end also wrote `G5.1 Q0` before `G80`. The FANUC 0i-F manual (B-64604EN-2/01, 3.3.2) does not permit `G5.1` in canned-cycle mode.\n\nOld output for a smoothed two-hole section (the pin's stream):\n\n```\nG81 X20. Y10. Z-5. R2. F200.\nG5.1 Q1 R5\nG5.1 Q0\nX20. Y10.\nG5.1 Q1 R5\nG5.1 Q0\nG80\n```\n\nNew output: `G81 ...`, `X20. Y10.`, `G80`, with no `G5.1` word between them.\n\n## Tests (final head 3484c8b3b)\n\n- Pin: `doosan_dnm_smoothing_stays_out_of_open_cycle_group`. It fails on unchanged upstream/main a721fd4dc (\"no G5.1 word inside the open cycle group\").\n- Mutation: I put the old `onLinear` line back. The pin failed. I restored the fix. The pin passed. With only the `endPreamble` reorder, that run wrote `G80` before `G5.1 Q0`.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-post --test doosan_dnm_post`: 10 passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 73 steps, 0 failed. This includes `app suites: example_catalog`, `example_catalog_adaptive`, `example_catalog_edge_work`, `conformance` and `doosan_dnm_a_state`.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main`: 2 steps (release build, `app heavy: probe_no_coolant`), 0 failed.\n- `cargo xtask gate light --base upstream/main`: 6 steps, 0 failed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. I ran the example catalog suites and `conformance`. They passed, and `git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty. Outside a cycle group the output is byte-identical.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No test stream puts an arc inside a cycle group. The `onCircular` guard has no pin of its own. It uses the same test as `onLinear`.\n- After the `onLinear` guard, smoothing cannot be active while a group is open. The `endPreamble` reorder thus has no independent pin. It is a second guard.\n- The program was not run on a Doosan control.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changes `assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps` or `crates/post/tests/doosan_dnm_post.rs`.\n\nChangelog: Doosan DNM post: with AICC smoothing on, a drilling section no longer writes G5.1 inside a canned-cycle group, and G80 now comes before G5.1 Q0.\n\nFixes #4347\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
